# What wrangler must NOT publish to www.srprolin.top.
#
# READ THIS BEFORE ADDING A FILE HERE OR IN .gitignore
# wrangler does not read .gitignore. It excludes exactly two things: its own built-ins
# (.git, node_modules) and the patterns in this file. The whole directory tree is
# uploaded as-is, so a scratch file that is merely git-ignored still ships to the public
# site. That is how a 16 MB pi-session-*.html transcript came within one local
# `npm run deploy` of being served. "Keep it out of git" and "keep it off the site" are
# two different lists, and this is the one that decides what visitors can download.
#
# Corollary: do NOT add fonts/ or js/vendor/ below. They are git-ignored but must be
# uploaded — CI builds them from npm before every deploy.

.git
.gitignore
.claude
.pi
.memory
.github
docs
.wrangler
.dev.vars

# Local scratch — session transcripts, logs. Never public, and never in git either.
pi-session*
*.log

# Build configuration: nothing on the site links to it, and it only exposes the deploy
# layout to visitors.
package.json
package-lock.json
tsconfig.json
wrangler.toml

node_modules
README.md
worker
scripts
